==Trivia==
*This [[Emotes|emote]] is based on a similar [[w:c:bthg:Taunts|taunt]] in ''RBLXWare'', which is inspired by a scene in ''Mother 3''.
**In ''Mother 3'', a character named Wess had to perform [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pUJ7K6ePYx0 the Osohe Dance] in order to open a door.
***The store description "''This is embarrassing. Turn the other way.''" is quoting Wess not wanting Duster to see him performing said dance.
***Wess's dance is specifically called the "Wess Dance" as there are other variations of the dance.
*The song used is a remixed version of the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2yJgwwDcgV8 Nyan Cat] music.

